        "x1": 197,
        "tag": "title",
        "text": "A Dressing for work"
      },
      {
        "y": 87.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 508.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Many students, both male and female, would agree that they often look scruffy1 in their T-shirts and"
      },
      {
        "y": 100.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 499.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "jeans. However, those who go into the world of business have to make a rapid transition and learn"
      },
      {
        "y": 111.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 494.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "about dress codes2 in the workplace. Business attire3 needs to project a professional image, and"
      },
      {
        "y": 123.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 518.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "clothing that reveals4 too much cleavage5 (for women), or your back, your chest or your midriff6 is not"
      },
      {
        "y": 135.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 504.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "appropriate, even in a casual business setting. For women, see-through fabrics7 should be avoided,"
      },
      {
        "y": 147.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 489.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "and skirts should not be too tight or too short, though nobody wants to look frumpy8. For men,"
      },
      {
        "y": 159.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 508.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "trousers should not be too tight, or shirts too open. Women often need a good choice of outfits9 and"
      },
      {
        "y": 171.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 515.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "men find a good range of suits10, ties and casual trousers and jackets invaluable11. Accessories12, e.g."
      },
      {
        "y": 183.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 499.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "jewellery, shoes and cufflinks13, can also enhance the professional look. Some offices have dress-"
      },
      {
        "y": 195.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 511.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "down days14, often Fridays, when staff can wear more casual clothes. In other jobs, of course, people"
      },
      {
        "y": 207.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 489.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "are required to wear uniforms, or protective clothing such as overalls15 and safety helmets16."
